      "description": "DINOv2 ViT-S/14 multi-view with 6 clinical MRI slots. Physical crop (160mm), spatial slice ordering via ImagePositionPatient, laterality normalization (right\u2192left knee). Diagnostic-specific 7-window TTA pooling (max for focal lesions, top2 for ACL/MCL, mean for diffuse). EMA (0.999), Focal Loss (alpha=0.25, gamma=2.0). Trained on ~4400 pseudo-labeled studies, validated on 58 gold studies (macro AUC 0.833). Inference only, no internet required.",
